# Apple Full Rules for Loon
# Maintained by Horatio
# Last verified: 2026-09-11
#
# Scope:
# Apple Account / iCloud / Private Relay / Apple Intelligence / Siri / Search
# App Store / TestFlight / Music / TV / News / Podcasts / Maps / Find My
# iMessage / FaceTime / APNs / Wallet / Apple Pay / system updates / Recovery
# Xcode / Developer / CloudKit / device activation / MDM / diagnostics / DNS / CDN
#
# Primary reference:
# https://support.apple.com/101555
# Apple notes that some CDN CNAME chains are dynamic and are not fully published.
# This ruleset therefore combines current official service endpoints with
# conservative Apple-owned service/CDN suffixes and Apple-specific CNAME targets.
#
# Loon Remote Rule example:
# https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hhhoratioxu/LOON-CONFIG-BY-HORATIOXU/main/Rule/Apple.list,policy=Apple,tag=Apple,enabled=true

# =========================
# Apple Intelligence / Siri / Search
# =========================
