# =========================
# Catch-all Apple namespaces
# Keep these near the end so specific third-party Apple service endpoints above
# remain obvious and independently documented.
# =========================
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple.org
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple

# =========================
# Apple-owned address space
# Official Apple enterprise-network guidance explicitly lists 17.0.0.0/8
# and the following IPv6 ranges.
# =========================
IP-CIDR,17.0.0.0/8,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2403:300::/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2620:149::/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2a01:b740::/32,no-resolve

# =========================
# Apple application User-Agent helpers
# Useful for Apple traffic that may terminate on changing third-party CDNs.
# =========================
USER-AGENT,*FindMyiPhone?
USER-AGENT,*Music?
